							</UDim2>
							<token name="SizeConstraint">0</token>
							<string name="Text">Well it&apos;s about time y&apos;showed up, eh? I&apos;ve lost my frying pan, and I&apos;m not sure who has it.</string>
							<Color3 name="TextColor3">4278190080</Color3>
